  "comments": "In view of the number of preserved folios of instance (ID:6113), this appears to be a concise guide, distinct from the topical outline (ID:6072).\r\nThis work could correspond to the \"don bdus\" listed by several Tibetan scholars (see <<Kano 2016 [BAQ9MH4T]>>: 204). \r\nA \"rnam bshad\" is also listed, which is not extant (ID: 6074). The latter is probably the commentary cited by bSod nams rtse mo (ID:3848) in work (ID:6832) (see [5U8AUKRL]: 287-288).",
